Signed-off-by: Kyrie Wu <kyrie.wu@mediatek.com>
Reviewed-by: Nicolas Dufresne <nicolas.dufresne@collabora.com>
---
 .../vcodec/decoder/mtk_vcodec_dec_hw.c        | 31 +++++++++++++++++++
