Suggested-by: Oleg Nesterov <oleg@redhat.com>
Reviewed-by: Bradley Morgan <include@grrlz.net>
Cc: stable@vger.kernel.org
Signed-off-by: Cen Zhang (Microsoft) <blbllhy@gmail.com>
